## 2. Key Accomplishments & Features

### Core Technology Stack
- **Python 3.14 / Django 4.2 LTS** with full production `.env` configuration.
- **WhiteNoise** static asset compression for live server deployments.
- **SQLite** development database configured with ORM migrations.
- **Pillow** automated asset texture pipeline generating realistic photos for all products (Construction Sand, River Sand, M-Sand, 10mm, 20mm, 40mm Aggregates, GSB).

### Database Models & Dynamic Engine
- [models.py](file:///d:/Charust%20university/Project/sand/sand_aggregates/website/models.py):
  - `Category`: Categorization for Sand, Stone Aggregates, and Road Sub-Base.
  - `Product`: Dynamic pricing per Ton/Truck/m³, availability toggles, short & long descriptions, image uploads.
  - `Order`: Unique auto-generated tracking numbers (`ORD-2026-XXXX`), unit price snapshotting, calculated totals, delivery site address, notes, and status lifecycle (`Pending`, `Confirmed`, `Processing`, `Delivered`, `Cancelled`).
  - `Enquiry`: Project inquiry management with company names, tonnage, location, and status.
  - `SiteSetting`: Singleton admin-editable model for phone numbers, WhatsApp digits, address, business hours, and social media URLs (Instagram, Facebook, YouTube, LinkedIn).

### User Ordering & Quotation Workflow
- **Interactive Price Calculator** in [order.html](file:///d:/Charust%20university/Project/sand/sand_aggregates/templates/order.html): Real-time JavaScript computation of total material cost (`Unit Price × Quantity = Total Amount`).
- **Confirmation Slip** in [order_success.html](file:///d:/Charust%20university/Project/sand/sand_aggregates/templates/order_success.html): Detailed receipt display with order number and a one-click WhatsApp button to ping dispatch managers with the order reference.
- **Catalog & Search** in [products.html](file:///d:/Charust%20university/Project/sand/sand_aggregates/templates/products.html): Category filtering pills, keyword search, stock badges.
- **Product Detail** in [product_detail.html](file:///d:/Charust%20university/Project/sand/sand_aggregates/templates/product_detail.html): Specifications, test grading details, and direct order/WhatsApp action triggers.

### Operations Dashboard & Admin Panel
- **Operations Dashboard** in [admin_dashboard.html](file:///d:/Charust%20university/Project/sand/sand_aggregates/templates/admin_dashboard.html):
  - Metric stat cards: Total Products, Available Products, Total Orders, Pending Orders, Delivered Orders, and Gross Order Value.
  - **Chart.js** Doughnut chart for Order Status and Bar chart for Enquiries.
  - Live dispatch activity tables.
- **Django Admin** in [admin.py](file:///d:/Charust%20university/Project/sand/sand_aggregates/website/admin.py):
  - Image thumbnails, quick price & stock editing, order filters, search by order number and customer name.

